      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 784,
        "height": 528,
        "content": "#  AI Product Video Generator\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Connect your **Google Drive** account.\n2. Connect your **OpenAI** account.\n3. Connect your **Groq** account.\n4. Add your **JSON2Video API key**.\n5. Make sure your Google Drive image folder is publicly accessible.\n\n### How It Works\n\n**Product Input \u2192 AI Prompts \u2192 3 Images \u2192 Voiceover \u2192 9:16 Video \u2192 Captions \u2192 Done**\n\n###  Customize\n\n* **Product & Image:** `Get Data`\n* **AI Prompts:** `Prompt Generator Agent`\n* **Voiceover:** `AI Agent` + `Generate audio`\n* **Scene Duration:** `Split Info`\n* **Captions:** `Split Info \u2192 subtitles`\n* **Video Format:** `Split Info \u2192 resolution`\n\n### \ud83d\udcf1 Output\n\n**1080\u00d71920 (9:16)** \u2014 YouTube Shorts, Reels & TikTok.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
